id=ocam_thermalfix
name=Oplus camera thermal bypass
version=v1.1
versionCode=2
author=Paras Moharle
description=Patches /system/framework/oplus-framework.jar so that the Oplus camera only (uid 10155) sees a capped skin temperature (30 degC / thermal level 0) instead of the real one. Camera 6.020.980 and 6.070.215 both hard-code a capture temperature threshold of 41 degC and defer every capture when the phone is warmer than that, which makes the shutter take 3-6 seconds and degrades the preview. Other processes keep seeing the real temperature. The patch is applied as a bind mount, the original file on disk is never modified. Disable this module after a ColorOS OTA.
